        <code>
          <a title="fix(workflow): serialize concurrent executions on same instance_id (DEBT-028)

Implement per-instance reference-counted async locking (_RefCountedLock and
_lock_instance) in WorkflowRuntime. Wrap execute() and resume() in _lock_instance
to serialize concurrent executions targeting the same instance_id and prevent
checkpoint corruption and graph collisions. Auto-prune locks on completion to
prevent memory leaks. Add comprehensive concurrency tests.

Co-authored-by: 1h0lde4 &lt;196927701+1h0lde4@users.noreply.github.com&gt;" data-pjax="true" class="Link--secondary markdown-title" href="/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/81/commits/7ba7145c739e0e161a8545d7151472cc9dedf763">fix(workflow): serialize concurrent executions on same instance_id (D…</a>
