existing execute() behavior (fresh UUID generation per execution) and _run()
execution_id identity behavior. Add deterministic concurrency tests in
test_workflow_runtime.py verifying pending node single-invocation, checkpoint
reuse by second callers, parallel execution for distinct instance IDs, and
lock cleanup across error and mismatch return paths.

