in test_workflow_runtime.py verifying concurrent resume() serialization, single
pending node execution, completed checkpoint observation by secondary callers,
parallel execution across distinct instance IDs, and lock cleanup on missing-checkpoint,
workflow-ID mismatch, and error/cancellation paths.

