          <a title="fix(workflow): serialize concurrent resume() operations on same instance_id (DEBT-028)

Narrow DEBT-028 concurrency lock strictly to WorkflowRuntime.resume() operations.
Wrap watchdog.stop() in try...finally in _run() for task cancellation safety.
Restore original execute() contract (fresh UUID instance_id generation per call)
and revert execution_id timestamp fallback in _run(). Add deterministic unit tests
in test_workflow_runtime.py verifying concurrent resume() serialization using
asyncio.Event primitives, single pending node execution, completed checkpoint observation
by secondary callers, parallel execution across distinct instance IDs, task cancellation
lock/watchdog cleanup, and error/mismatch cleanup. Reconcile KNOWN_ISSUES.md DEBT-028 entry.

Co-authored-by: 1h0lde4 &lt;196927701+1h0lde4@users.noreply.github.com&gt;" data-pjax="true" class="Link--secondary markdown-title" href="/1h0lde4/ocbrain-v4.1/pull/81/commits/285cac8085d54c961446fbf21da671b5e34d6028">fix(workflow): serialize concurrent resume() operations on same insta…</a>
        </code>

